# Shell, Python, YAML and patch files must keep LF line endings: CRLF breaks
# `bash`, shebangs, and `git apply`. (Editing from Windows/Android tools or
# re-importing a ZIP silently converts them otherwise.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.patch -text
*.zip binary
anykernel/tools/busybox binary
anykernel/tools/magiskboot binary
anykernel/tools/magiskpolicy binary
anykernel/tools/fec binary
anykernel/tools/*_static binary
